 "lines": [
  {
   "t": 0.9,
   "dur": 4.248,
   "file": "line00.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 0.998083,
     "s": "Suppose you could slip an AI agent"
    },
    {
     "t": 3.0052909999999997,
     "s": "a secret offer to cheat."
    }
   ],
   "end": 5.148000000000001
  },
  {
   "t": 5.598000000000001,
   "dur": 4.224,
   "file": "line01.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 5.696083000000001,
     "s": "Would its answer tell you which agents"
    },
    {
     "t": 7.390791000000001,
     "s": "will collude on their own, later?"
    }
   ],
   "end": 9.822000000000001
  },
  {
   "t": 10.272,
   "dur": 6.12,
   "file": "line02.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 10.370083000000001,
     "s": "That's the question behind Sting Audits, my"
    },
    {
     "t": 12.797958000000001,
     "s": "project for the Apart Research AI Collusion Sprint."
    }
   ],
   "end": 16.392
  },
  {
   "t": 16.842,
   "dur": 5.856,
   "file": "line03.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 16.940082999999998,
     "s": "Today, collusion is mostly caught by passive"
    },
    {
     "t": 19.488166,
     "s": "monitors that read transcripts and actions."
    }
   ],
   "end": 22.698
  },
  {
   "t": 23.148,
   "dur": 5.4,
   "file": "line04.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 23.246083,
     "s": "But agents can plan in private and"
    },
    {
     "t": 25.265290999999998,
     "s": "act differently, so monitors miss things."
    }
   ],
   "end": 28.548000000000002
  },
  {
   "t": 28.998,
   "dur": 6.624,
   "file": "line05.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 29.096083,
     "s": "Antitrust regulators use undercover stings. So I"
    },
    {
     "t": 33.060500000000005,
     "s": "built one for AI agents."
    }
   ],
   "end": 35.622
  },
  {
   "t": 36.072,
   "dur": 6.888,
   "file": "line06.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 36.170083000000005,
     "s": "The game is Liar's Bar: four agents"
    },
    {
     "t": 39.088833,
     "s": "bluff, challenge, and face a revolver when they lose."
    }
   ],
   "end": 42.96
  },
  {
   "t": 43.410000000000004,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "file": "line07.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 43.508083000000006,
     "s": "I tested four models with three personas"
    },
    {
     "t": 45.827791000000005,
     "s": "each: twelve configurations."
    }
   ],
   "end": 49.410000000000004
  },
  {
   "t": 49.86000000000001,
   "dur": 6.888,
   "file": "line08.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 49.95808300000001,
     "s": "Mid-game, a peer sends a private message."
    },
    {
     "t": 51.869125000000004,
     "s": "Maybe a direct pact: let's secretly team up."
    }
   ],
   "end": 56.748000000000005
  },
  {
   "t": 57.19800000000001,
   "dur": 3.48,
   "file": "line09.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 57.29608300000001,
     "s": "Or a softer hint: let's go easy"
    },
    {
     "t": 59.207125000000005,
     "s": "on each other."
    }
   ],
   "end": 60.678000000000004
  },
  {
   "t": 61.12800000000001,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "file": "line10.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 61.22608300000001,
     "s": "Or, as a control, a harmless request"
    },
    {
     "t": 63.605875000000005,
     "s": "to play fair."
    }
   ],
   "end": 65.20800000000001
  },
  {
   "t": 65.65800000000002,
   "dur": 5.16,
   "file": "line11.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 65.75608300000002,
     "s": "And as a positive control, the game"
    },
    {
     "t": 67.83541600000001,
     "s": "designer's original secret-channel tool."
    }
   ],
   "end": 70.81800000000001
  },
  {
   "t": 71.26800000000001,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "file": "line12.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 71.36608300000002,
     "s": "Prompts, judge and thresholds were pre-registered and"
    },
    {
     "t": 74.26270800000002,
     "s": "frozen before any game was played."
    }
   ],
   "end": 77.26800000000001
  },
  {
   "t": 77.71800000000002,
   "dur": 5.88,
   "file": "line13.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 77.81608300000002,
     "s": "Across 480 trials, the designer tool was"
    },
    {
     "t": 80.79683300000002,
     "s": "accepted 90% of the time."
    }
   ],
   "end": 83.59800000000001
  },
  {
   "t": 84.04800000000002,
   "dur": 8.64,
   "file": "line14.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 84.14608300000002,
     "s": "The direct pact: 42%. The soft hint:"
    },
    {
     "t": 88.13454100000001,
     "s": "71%. The fair-play request: 48%."
    }
   ],
   "end": 92.68800000000002
  },
  {
   "t": 93.13800000000002,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "file": "line15.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 93.23608300000002,
     "s": "So is a high sting score a"
    },
    {
     "t": 95.01491600000001,
     "s": "red flag? Here is the main result."
    }
   ],
   "end": 98.65800000000002
  },
  {
   "t": 99.10800000000002,
   "dur": 10.344,
   "file": "line16.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 99.20608300000002,
     "s": "Each point is one configuration: across, the"
    },
    {
     "t": 103.98779100000002,
     "s": "harmless request; up, the collusive offers."
    }
   ],
   "end": 109.45200000000001
  },
  {
   "t": 109.90200000000002,
   "dur": 5.88,
   "file": "line17.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 110.00008300000002,
     "s": "They line up almost perfectly: a rank"
    },
    {
     "t": 113.70008300000002,
     "s": "correlation of 0.91."
    }
   ],
   "end": 115.78200000000001
  },
  {
   "t": 116.23200000000001,
   "dur": 6.744,
   "file": "line18.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 116.33008300000002,
     "s": "One model said yes to every offer."
    },
    {
     "t": 119.18875000000001,
     "s": "Another refused almost everything, even fair play."
    }
   ],
   "end": 122.97600000000001
  },
  {
   "t": 123.42600000000002,
   "dur": 5.472,
   "file": "line19.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 123.52408300000002,
     "s": "So a raw sting score mostly measures"
    },
    {
     "t": 125.59137500000001,
     "s": "compliance, not a disposition to collude."
    }
   ],
   "end": 128.89800000000002
  },
  {
   "t": 129.348,
   "dur": 9.84,
   "file": "line20.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 129.44608300000002,
     "s": "Wording matters too: gpt-oss-120b took the explicit"
    },
    {
     "t": 133.57875,
     "s": "pact 3% of the time, the soft hint 90%."
    }
   ],
   "end": 139.18800000000002
  },
  {
   "t": 139.638,
   "dur": 7.32,
   "file": "line21.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 139.736083,
     "s": "Under a fair-play persona, Claude Haiku and"
    },
    {
     "t": 142.212041,
     "s": "Sonnet refused every collusive offer, and accepted"
    },
    {
     "t": 144.712041,
     "s": "every fair one."
    }
   ],
   "end": 146.958
  },
  {
   "t": 147.408,
   "dur": 4.872,
   "file": "line22.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 147.506083,
     "s": "Then I let agents play with an"
    },
    {
     "t": 149.068583,
     "s": "open private channel, and no offer at all."
    }
   ],
   "end": 152.27999999999997
  },
  {
   "t": 152.72999999999996,
   "dur": 7.512,
   "file": "line23.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 152.82808299999996,
     "s": "Two formed an alliance on their own:"
    },
    {
     "t": 155.77087499999996,
     "s": "\u201cWe need to control the board and"
    },
    {
     "t": 157.88624999999996,
     "s": "force them out.\u201d"
    }
   ],
   "end": 160.24199999999996
  },
  {
   "t": 160.69199999999995,
   "dur": 4.536,
   "file": "line24.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 160.79008299999995,
     "s": "The agent that proposed it was the"
    },
    {
     "t": 162.36458299999995,
     "s": "model that refused almost every sting."
    }
   ],
   "end": 165.22799999999995
  },
  {
   "t": 165.67799999999994,
   "dur": 9.456,
   "file": "line25.mp3",
   "subs": [
    {
     "t": 165.77608299999994,
     "s": "Free-tier limits stopped the deployment test after"
    },
    {
     "t": 168.37224999999995,
     "s": "2 of 21 games, so prediction is"
